---
// promptanddone.com/anatomy — the ANATOMY pack (DM deliverable for the "anatomy-claude-machines" reel). Prepared, not deployed.
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const install = 'npx skills add wheresryan22/anatomy -g -a claude-code';
const prompt = '/anatomy explain how an LLM picks its next word and what temperature does, interactive. One HTML page, light theme, fits a phone screen.';
---
<BaseLayout title="Anatomy: one line, a working machine — Prompt &amp; Done">
  <main>
    <header>
      <p class="kicker"><a href="/">Prompt &amp; Done</a> · ANATOMY pack</p>
      <h1>One line to Claude, a working machine</h1>
      <p class="tag">Anatomy is a free, open-source (MIT) Claude Code skill by @wheresryan22. Ask how something works and it builds an interactive figure you can drag and tap.</p>
    </header>
    <section class="card"><h2><span class="n">1</span> Install (Claude Code)</h2><pre><code>{install}</code></pre>
      <p>Needs Node.js 20.10+ and Chrome (for its self-checks). No API keys. Also runs in Codex, OpenCode, Antigravity and MiniMax Code: see the README.</p>
      <p><a href="https://github.com/wheresryan22/anatomy">github.com/wheresryan22/anatomy</a></p></section>
    <section class="card"><h2><span class="n">2</span> The exact prompt from the reel</h2><pre><code>{prompt}</code></pre>
      <p>Our run (17 Oct 2026): Claude Opus 5.5 in Claude Code, 6 min 40 s, $1.77 of usage at API list price. The word odds in that machine are example numbers; the softmax and temperature maths are real.</p></section>
    <section class="card"><h2><span class="n">3</span> Know before you run it</h2>
      <p>It uses your Claude plan or API usage. Small figures took us minutes; big ones take much longer (a review measured about 2 hours for a mechanical watch). It draws machines and instruments, not charts or people.</p></section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  main {
    width: min(100% - 2.25rem, 44rem);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 7vh, 4rem) 0 2.5rem;
  }
  .kicker { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--soft); margin: 0 0 1.25rem; }
  .kicker a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; }
  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 8.5vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -.03em;
    white-space: normal;
  }
  .tag { margin: 1rem 0 0; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--soft); }
  .card {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 1.4rem 1.35rem;
    background: #101011;
  }
  .card h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .65rem;
  }
  .n {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 1.9rem;
    height: 1.9rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #191100;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    flex: none;
  }
  .sub { margin: .6rem 0 0; color: var(--soft); font-size: .95rem; }
  .prompt {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    font-size: .92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: .6rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .copy {
    margin-top: .9rem;
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: .95rem;
    color: #191100;
    background: var(--accent);
    border: none;
    border-radius: .6rem;
    padding: .7rem 1.3rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
  }
  .how ol, .how ul { margin: .8rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.3rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink); }
  .how li { margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  .sub a { color: var(--accent); }
  footer { margin-top: 2.5rem; color: var(--soft); font-size: .85rem; }
  .games { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .75rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .game {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .3rem;
    padding: 1rem; border-radius: .8rem; border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none;
  }
  .game strong { font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .game span { color: var(--soft); font-size: .9rem; }
  .game:hover, .game:focus-visible { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; margin-top: 1rem; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .92rem; }
  th, td { text-align: left; padding: .5rem .6rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); white-space: nowrap; }
  th { color: var(--soft); font-weight: 600; }
</style>

